      "context.situation": "This simulated document-download service has reported potentially unexpected request paths or responses. Compare ordinary document retrieval with requests attempting to access unauthorized locations.",
      "context.objective": "Practice correlating the requested name, the path normalized by the application, and file-operation audits against the permitted area. Distinguish receiving a request from actually reading a file.",
